{
  "info": {
    "name": "Plataforma de Eventos e Inscripciones — flujo completo",
    "schema": "https://schema.getpostman.com/json/collection/v2.1.0/collection.json",
    "description": "Recorre el flujo completo de la entrega final. Antes de correrla: 1) `npm run seed` para crear admin/organizer/user de prueba, 2) completá la variable `seedPassword` con el valor de SEED_PASSWORD, 3) ejecutá la carpeta 'Flujo completo' EN ORDEN (Runner). La cookie currentUser la maneja el cookie jar de Postman."
  },
  "item": [
    {
      "name": "Salud",
      "item": [
        {
          "name": "GET /api/health",
          "event": [
            {
              "listen": "test",
              "script": {
                "type": "text/javascript",
                "exec": [
                  "pm.test('Status 200', () => pm.response.to.have.status(200));"
                ]
              }
            }
          ],
          "request": {
            "method": "GET",
            "header": [],
            "url": {
              "raw": "{{baseUrl}}/api/health",
              "host": [
                "{{baseUrl}}"
              ],
              "path": [
                "api",
                "health"
              ]
            }
          }
        }
      ]
    },
